{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/\u6807\u9898\u56fe1EN.png?t=1745483052\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ship crashed, only a pickaxe left? Don\u2019t panic\u2014start by mining stones and gradually craft tools and build a shelter!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/GIF1EN.gif?t=1745483052\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tame an alien panther as your bodyguard and &quot;recruit&quot; alien villagers as laborers\u2014turn your survival struggle into a ruthless factory in no time!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/GIF2EN.gif?t=1745483052\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead them to explore the unknown, challenge powerful alien bosses, unlock high-tech advancements, and build a luxurious survivor base\u2014or craft a starship and make your great escape!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/GIF3EN.gif?t=1745483052\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/\u6807\u9898\u56fe2EN.png?t=1745483052\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 20x20 procedurally generated alien world\u2014discover exotic creatures and plants unseen on Earth. Head right for resource-rich mines, or left into the insectoid hive\u2026 where survival is uncertain!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/GIF4EN.gif?t=1745483052\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of random events: rescue trapped miners, meet a pilot fishing for boots in the swamp, and more! Every adventure is full of surprises\u2014are you ready for the challenge?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/GIF5EN.gif?t=1745483052\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/\u6807\u9898\u56fe3EN.png?t=1745483052\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to jump farther? Extract rabbit DNA! Want to hit harder? Take wolf DNA! Here, every creature is your personal \u201cgene bank.\u201d</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/GIF6EN.gif?t=1745483052\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to genetic modification, you can even domesticate them or ride them across the planet, becoming the alien overlord!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/GIF7EN.gif?t=1745483052\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/\u6807\u9898\u56fe4EN.png?t=1745483052\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit alien workers: farming, mining, no complaints! They\u2019re all your laborers, letting you enjoy the pleasure of being the boss!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/GIF8EN.gif?t=1745483052\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automated production line: Mine, herd, and plant during the day, craft iron and cook food at night, and serve as an alarm system before dawn! We\u2019re also preparing a multiplayer co-op system, which will be updated soon after the game launches. Gather your friends and become &quot;xeno-capitalists&quot; together!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/GIF9EN.gif?t=1745483052\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/\u6807\u9898\u56fe5EN.png?t=1745483052\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set up a stall to attract traders, turning your place into the alien trade hub and the \u201cnew CBD\u201d!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/GIF10EN.gif?t=1745483052\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run a viral alien restaurant offering food, entertainment, and accommodation, boosting the GDP to new heights! The creative workshop will also be opened, showcasing the power of your &quot;infrastructure prowess&quot; to the entire universe!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/GIF11EN.gif?t=1745483052\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3461270?t=1745483052","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/a00cc03ab1560e4edaf25c65d529a10fe33f363d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745483052","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/e15934ef9a61e1566b71151c1762c51af68fe430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745483052","capsule_i