s://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/GIF3EN.gif?t=1745483052\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/\u6807\u9898\u56fe2EN.png?t=1745483052\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 20x20 procedurally generated alien world\u2014discover exotic creatures and plants unseen on Earth. Head right for resource-rich mines, or left into the insectoid hive\u2026 where survival is uncertain!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/GIF4EN.gif?t=1745483052\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of random events: rescue trapped miners, meet a pilot fishing for boots in the swamp, and more! Every adventure is full of surprises\u2014are you ready for the challenge?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/GIF5EN.gif?t=1745483052\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/\u6807\u9898\u56fe3EN.png?t=1745483052\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to jump farther? Extract rabbit DNA! Want to hit harder? Take wolf DNA! Here, every creature is your personal \u201cgene bank.\u201d</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/GIF6EN.gif?t=1745483052\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to genetic modification, you can even domesticate them or ride them across the planet, becoming the alien overlord!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/GIF7EN.gif?t=1745483052\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/\u6807\u9898\u56fe4EN.png?t=1745483052\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit alien workers: farming, mining, no complaints! They\u2019re all your laborers, letting you enjoy the pleasure of being the boss!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/GIF8EN.gif?t=1745483052\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automated production line: Mine, herd, and plant during the day, craft iron and cook food at night, and serve as an alarm system before dawn! We\u2019re also preparing a multiplayer co-op system, which will be updated soon after the game launches. Gather your friends and become &quot;xeno-capitalists&quot; together!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/GIF9EN.gif?t=1745483052\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/\u6807\u9898\u56fe5EN.png?t=1745483052\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set up a stall to attract traders, turning your place into the alien trade hub and the \u201cnew CBD\u201d!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/GIF10EN.gif?t=1745483052\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run a viral alien restaurant offering food, entertainment, and accommodation, boosting the GDP to new heights! The creative workshop will also be opened, showcasing the power of your &quot;infrastructure prowess&quot; to the entire universe!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/GIF11EN.gif?t=1745483052\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Miniverse Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/a158db702cf83ed7ed58021e98e7e2f5d9601b23/header.jpg?t=1745483052","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257119445,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119445/movie480.mp4?t=1743151001","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119445/movie_max.mp4?t=1743151001"},"name":"PV1-EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257119445/dc880ed1623e6374fc95d47749e887bcf02b2503/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743151001","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119445/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743151001","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119445/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743151001"}}],"name":"XenoHaven","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win10 &amp; Win11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650 or AMD Radeon HD 7750<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win10 &amp; Win11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>